Captured 2026-09-10 from inside the desktop container, by running the image's
own entrypoint as PID 1 but keeping the container alive so the output survives:

  entrypoint = ["/bin/sh", "-c"]
  command    = ["/dockerstartup/vnc_startup.sh --wait > /tmp/boot.log 2>&1; echo \"PID1_EXIT=$?\" >> /tmp/boot.log; sleep infinity"]

